{On the \SK lead, North should play the \SJ! "I have the \S10."\n
Declarer should draw trumps as soon as she could, but not necessarily right
away. She must get  rid of one of those nasty spade losers first.\n
Declarer plays AKQ of diamonds discarding a spade. Only then does she draw
trumps.}
[BCFlags "1f"]
[Auction "E"]
1H Pass 3H Pass
4H AP

